---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="TraceWell — Coyote & Quill"
  description="TraceWell — The Compliance Backbone for Healthcare Innovation. A proprietary SaaS platform owned and developed by Coyote & Quill."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">Proprietary Product</p>
      <h1>TraceWell</h1>
      <p>The Compliance Backbone for Healthcare Innovation. A proprietary SaaS platform owned and developed by Coyote &amp; Quill.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
        <span class="badge badge-active"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Active Development</span>
        <span class="badge" style="background: rgba(27,58,107,0.2); color: var(--ice-blue); border: 1px solid rgba(27,58,107,0.4);">Copyright Protected</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p class="label">What It Is</p>
          <h2>Built to solve the problems we lived with.</h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>TraceWell is not a concept or a prototype. It is a live, actively developed healthcare SaaS platform — built by the same practitioner who navigated HIPAA compliance, FDA 21 CFR Part 11 requirements, and SOC 2 audit readiness simultaneously at a healthcare startup.</p>
          <p>The platform is Coyote &amp; Quill's flagship product and the most direct proof that the firm builds what it recommends.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card">
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
              <tbody>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(74,96,128,0.2);">
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem; width: 40%;">Product Type</td>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--off-white);">SaaS — Healthcare Technology</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(74,96,128,0.2);">
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem;">Owner</td>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--off-white);">Coyote &amp; Quill LLC</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(74,96,128,0.2);">
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem;">Intellectual Property</td>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--off-white);">Proprietary — copyright-protected</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(74,96,128,0.2);">
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem;">Development</td>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--off-white);">Active — solo developer</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem;">Target Market</td>
                  <td style="padding: 12px 0; color: var(--off-white);">Healthcare providers, pharmacogenomics, preventive care</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">Strategic Role</p>
        <h2>Why TraceWell exists within Coyote &amp; Quill.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Credibility Anchor</p>
          <h3>Exhibit A</h3>
          <p>TraceWell is the answer to every client who asks "have you actually built anything?" It is a live product in active development — and it has been used in the field: a health system's clinical-innovation institute used TraceWell to track the development requirements for their genomics platform. Not a demo. Not a side project.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Revenue Channel</p>
          <h3>SaaS Licensing</h3>
          <p>TraceWell operates as a secondary revenue stream alongside consulting engagements — SaaS licensing to healthcare providers and platforms in the firm's target markets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">IP Asset</p>
          <h3>Defensible Value</h3>
          <p>TraceWell is proprietary and copyright-protected — and its real defensibility is domain depth: it is purpose-built for the compliance and traceability gap in healthcare innovation, not competing with generic EHR platforms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="placeholder-section">
        <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Coming Soon</p>
        <p>Full product details, screenshots, and investor one-pager will be added here ahead of launch.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Interested in early access or an investor conversation? <a href="/contact">Reach out directly.</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Interested in TraceWell?</p>
      <h2 style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">Early access and investor conversations are open.</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
